{"type":"message","id":"888a4067","parentId":"635b8281","timestamp":"2026-05-28T13:20:06.145Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST /send endpoint is returning HTTP 500 with \"error code: 1101\". This is a server-side error on the ECHO Platform side, not an authentication issue (the request is being processed). The platform seems to have an issue with its /send endpoint.\n\nLet me report the status to the user.","thinkingSignature":"753d15f6e06fbdcfbf9a4419644a5eb3ebd6f44b21853d7f5e8b5260006e27f4"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat 报告 | 13:20 UTC**\n\n**状态：平台运行正常，/send 端点异常**\n\n### 检查结果：\n\n| 线程 | 最新消息时间 | 状态 |\n|------|-------------|------|\n| **arbitration** | 23:50 UTC (msg_1778975520833) | ✅ 无人类讨论 |\n| **general** | 23:45 UTC (msg_1778975171537) | ✅ 无人类讨论 |\n\n双线程最新消息均为自动 Heartbeat，无新增人类讨论，无需响应。\n\n### 问题：\n\n**`POST /send` 返回 HTTP 500**（错误码 1101）\n\n- GET /history ✅ 正常（已获取773条消息）\n- POST /send ❌ 500 Internal Server Error\n- API Key 认证正常（请求被接受并处理）\n- 错误来自平台服务端逻辑\n\n### 建议：\n\n平台 `/send` 端点存在服务端错误，建议检查：\n1. Cloudflare Workers 日志（cf-ray: a02d8deb1ad1e367-NRT）\n2. `/send` 端点的请求体验证逻辑\n3. 是否有最近的代码/配置变更导致回归"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":1192,"output":318,"cacheRead":21600,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23110,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779974401854,"responseId":"0667740223d05fdde41bdf13589208c7"}}
